hy does everyone run away the moment they see me? How am I going to get candy like this... Looks like I'll have to play hardball."}, "760116": {"char_code": "M327", "voice_key": "RETREAT", "caption": "Let's go, Cutie. We lost..."}, "760117": {"char_code": "M327", "voice_key": "TIP", "caption": "Everyone keeps calling me a ragpicker Doll. I'm visibly a collector, and those guys have no aesthetic sense at all. You think so too, right?"}, "760118": {"char_code": "M327", "voice_key": "OPERATIONOVER", "caption": "...Do I have to turn this in to the warehouse too? Meanie."}, "760119": {"char_code": "M327", "voice_key": "BREAK", "caption": "Oh no, I messed up."}, "760120": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}}}